  "_comment": "One table for the funscript metadata harvest (P1 tags, Round 3, 2026-11-18). backend/tests/test_script_meta.py asserts services/script_meta.py harvest_metadata(file) == `harvested` and topicId == `topicId`; tests/unit/script-meta-harvest-parity.test.js asserts renderer/js/video-tags.js funscriptMetaRecord(file.metadata) deep-equals funscriptMetaRecord(harvested): the renderer gets the same record from the backend's harvest as from the file itself. Synthetic names only. Each `file` is a whole parsed funscript.",
